{
  "//": [
    "=======================================================================",
    " VivekMind — Universal AI Provider Settings Template",
    "=======================================================================",
    "",
    " HOW TO USE:",
    " 1. Copy this file to ~/.vivekmind/settings.json",
    "    (or let VivekMind auto-create it on first run)",
    " 2. Uncomment the providers you want to use",
    " 3. Set the corresponding environment variable for each provider's API key",
    "    e.g.  export OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...",
    " 4. Run: vivekmind",
    "",
    " ⚠️  SECURITY WARNING:",
    " NEVER put real API keys in this file!",
    " Use the 'envKey' field to reference environment variables only.",
    " NEVER commit settings.json with real credentials to version control.",
    "",
    " Each provider entry under 'modelProviders' is keyed by authType.",
    " All OpenAI-compatible providers use authType 'openai'.",
    " Native providers use their own authType (anthropic, gemini, bedrock).",
    "======================================================================="
  ],

